OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly dry
OL,6,Fevening, then a band of heavy rain
OL,7,Fsweeps through quickly overnight, only
OL,8,Flingering in the east by dawn. Winds
OL,9,Fstrengthen through the night, with
OL,10,Fisolated gales in exposed areas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FOnce lingering rain clears, a
OL,13,Fbright and breezy day follows with
OL,14,Fisolated showers and plenty of sunny
OL,15,Fspells. Feeling fresh in the strong
OL,16,Fbreeze, this easing through the
OL,17,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
