OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells and light winds
OL,7,FWednesday. Overnight mist or fog
OL,8,Fpatches possible, clearing to a
OL,9,Fsimilar day Thursday. Cloud starts to
OL,10,Fbuild again later Friday.
